  "previewComment": "Shared cases for the drop rules: the reorder from insert_index (superset/canvas/definition/grid.py), applied by the place operation, followed by resolve_grid. The reorder does not live in resolve_grid, so the cases above do not reach it. Generated from the server, which is the authority; the client mirrors it in previewGrid. `order` is reading order after the drop, asserted separately because two orders can settle on the same placements while differing for the next drop.",
  "previewCases": [
